cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software, please cite the paper below."
title: "Analysis code for X-ray Driven Trihydrogen Formation on Silica Nanosurfaces"
abstract: >-
  Analysis, figure-generation and simulation code for the single-particle
  X-ray study of trihydrogen formation on hydrated silica nanoparticles,
  European XFEL proposal 3408 (SQS instrument, NQS endstation).
type: software
license: BSD-3-Clause
version: 1.0.0
repository-code: "https://github.com/samsahsch/EuXFEL_nano_analysis"

